                    <pre class="azure-notes-text">4. ADD

If we define to add some files, ADD statement is used. It basically gives instructions to copy new files,
directories, or remote file URLs and then adds them to the filesystem of the image.
To sum up it can add local files, contents of tar archives as well as URLs.

Example:

Local Files: ADD run.sh /run.sh

Tar Archives: ADD project.tar.gz /install/

URLs: ADD https://project.demo-test.com/downloads/1.0/testingproject.rpm/test</pre>
